// Edexcel GCSE (9–1) Mathematics 1MA1 — Ratio, proportion and rates of change, batch 1.
// Specification references (Issue 2; Foundation and Higher lists compared 22 October 2026):
//   R1 units and compound units (rates of pay, exchange) · R3 one quantity as a fraction of another ·
//   R4 ratio notation and simplest form · R5 sharing in a ratio, mixing and scaling · R6 multiplicative
//   relationships as ratios or fractions · R7 proportion as equality of ratios · R8 ratios, fractions
//   and linear functions · R9 percentages, percentage change, original value, simple interest ·
//   R10 direct and inverse proportion (word problems) · R11 unit pricing and rates of pay ·
//   R16 growth and decay, compound interest (Higher: iterative processes).
// Batch 2 adds R2 scale, R12 similarity ratios, R10/R13 algebraic proportion and R14/R15 rates of
// change; speed, density and pressure are taught in Number (N13).
// All teaching text and questions are original.
